        <item>
            <title>2.8.8</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 14:43:25 +0545</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/mk-manishkandel/MacClipboard</link>
            <sparkle:version>71</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.8.8</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Easier to read and click: copied items have more space, the filter tabs are bigger, and the scroll bar no longer covers items. The history popup now opens at most 520 points tall instead of 800; drag its edge to make it taller.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
