        <item>
            <title>2.8.6</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:42:46 +0545</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/mk-manishkandel/MacClipboard</link>
            <sparkle:version>69</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.8.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Right-click any text item and choose Paste as to paste it in UPPERCASE, lowercase or Title Case, with spaces trimmed, with lines joined, as pretty JSON, or as a link with tracking codes removed. Save text you use often as a snippet with New Snippet… in the menu bar menu. New tabs under the search field show only text, links, images, files or snippets. The app is now English only.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/mk-manishkandel/MacClipboard/releases/download/v2.8.6/MacClipboard-2.8.6.zip" length="7030358" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="1A/ucITnffoXvEsG93hk/d60/6CaU2e+j1P4Y6hVLdflQhpSfaLQkFsRY6iwyBIQ37CqrPoo7naTsTsitQ0HAA=="/>
